The four openec-*.patch files in scripts/ec/reference are local
modifications, not unmodified upstream releases:
- openec-algorithm-01.patch corrects the GF width passed to matrix inversion.
- openec-algorithm-02.patch releases decoded matrix allocations.
- openec-algorithm-03.patch gives the computation matrix owned storage.
- openec-posix.patch adds a local POSIX backend and its build selection.

Patch headers and hunks identify the changed source files and lines.
